{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Who, etc.</b> Is there a madness like that of one who fashions an el and calls it according to his thought:" "<b>Nesekh.</b> Like 'a cast calf' (Jeremiah 7:5) [to no avail]."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra cites Jeremiah 7:5 but the phrase 'עגל מסכה' does not occur there; it appears at Hosea 8:5 and Hosea 10:5. Retained the citation as given."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:55.156808608Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}